nger-report-reason">不適切なアイコン</label></li><li><label><input type="radio" value="impersonation" name="housinger-report-reason">なりすまし</label></li><li><label><input type="radio" value="other" name="housinger-report-reason">その他</label></li></ul><textarea class="housing-report-comment" placeholder="詳細を教えてください (任意)" maxlength="500" rows="3"></textarea><div class="housing-report-actions"><button type="button">キャンセル</button><button type="button" class="housing-btn-primary">報告する</button></div></div></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`HousingerPage 分割前後の HTML 固定 > 未ログインのマイページ 1`] = `"<div><div class="housing-detail-panel"><div class="housing-detail-shell housinger-page-login-shell"><main class="housing-detail-fullpage-main housinger-page-login-main"><div class="housing-login-prompt" data-context="mypage"><p class="housing-login-prompt-title">マイページを見るにはログインが必要です</p><p class="housing-login-prompt-lead">ログインすると、自分の登録物件やお気に入りをまとめて管理できます</p><button type="button" class="housing-action-btn housing-btn-primary housing-login-prompt-cta">ログイン画面を開く</button></div></main></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`HousingerPage 分割前後の HTML 固定 > 本人視点: 一覧+代表作+名前編集+アイコン窓+公開切替の窓 > アイコン窓 1`] = `"<div><div class="housing-detail-panel"><div class="housing-detail-shell"><header class="housing-detail-fullpage-header housinger-page-headerbar"><a class="housing-detail-back" aria-label="戻る" href="/housing" data-discover="true">← 戻る</a></header><main class="housing-detail-fullpage-main housinger-page-main"><div class="housinger-page-body"><div class="housinger-page-profile-col"><div class="housinger-page-identity"><div class="housinger-page-avatar-wrap"><span class="housinger-avatar housinger-page-avatar"><span class="housinger-avatar-fallback" aria-hidden="true">た</span></span><button type="button" class="housinger-page-avatar-edit-btn" aria-label="アバターを変更" title="アバターを変更"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-camera" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.997 4a2 2 0 0 1 1.76 1.05l.486.9A2 2 0 0 0 18.003 7H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V9a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h1.997a2 2 0 0 0 1.759-1.048l.489-.904A2 2 0 0 1 10.004 4z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="3"></circle></svg></button></div><div class="housinger-page-name-editor"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 w-full"><div class="relative"><input maxlength="30" class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-[16px] md:text-app-lg text-app-text bg-transparent border border-app-border focus:outline-none focus:border-app-text/40 transition-colors disabled:opacity-50" type="text" value="たかし"><span class="absolute right-2 bottom-2 text-app-base text-app-text-muted/50">3/30</span></div><div class="flex gap-2 justify-end"><button type="button" aria-label="キャンセル" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-app-base flex items-center gap-1 transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer text-app-text-muted hover:text-app-text border border-app-border hover:border-app-text/40 active:scale-95"><svg xmln